author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "A declaration naming a field or collection the loaded item population cannot carry is refused at evaluation time with the field named, rather than answered with a count; The links source resolves files, tests and docs for every item it judges, and both present and missing polarities match the values the corresponding read command returns for the same item; An items declaration can express field-is-absent-or-empty as a first-class predicate, so counting items missing a value is expressible without relying on equals null; A negative control proves each repaired source fails when the population genuinely lacks the evidence and passes when it has it, using a fixture whose truth is read back through the ordinary command surface rather than asserted; Any verdict already persisted from an affected declaration is identifiable after the fix, so a passing verdict produced by the defect is never mistaken for a passing verdict produced by the property"
parent: pm-1jzupz
